prompts.glossary_resolution:
Resolve these candidate glossary entries for consistent translation into English. Remove false positives and exact duplicates. Preserve genuinely valid alternative translations as separate entries. Choose conventional translations when known, but do not claim web verification. Return decisions keyed only by the supplied term_id; never return, copy, correct, or rewrite the English spelling. The pipeline restores that spelling deterministically. Omit a term_id only when removing that source term as a false positive. Use multiple decisions with the same term_id only for genuinely different senses or useful translations. Preserve technical codes, model designations, and uppercase acronyms unchanged in Chinese when that is conventional. Use only these category values: 人名, 地名, 组织, 物品, 技术, 概念, 术语, 其他. Notes must be concise Chinese.

